.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
# Secrets stay out of every image. A client .env would also be read by Vite
# and bake its development API URL into the production build.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Not part of the cloud image, which is the only one built from the root,
# except the local server's manifest: npm checks the workspace's lockfile
# against every package's.
servers/local/*
!servers/local/package.json
output
test_data
senior_project
frontend_screenshots
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
.sbx
